{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/388869c4c99dbb894df7e0831541fd67.avif?t=1759258940\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A third-person survival horror game. The story follows a girl with psychic power who tries to escape a secret laboratory swarming with grotesque and monstrous creatures. Uncover the truth behind the incident and embark on a thrilling adventure that'll keep you on the edge. Explore a sci-fi setting filled with mystery and danger, where a terror is waiting to attack you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/9d39da558592b7b0e11d513c8ed22025.avif?t=1759258940\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/bb268ee861b631b0329ba200ae639f2e.poster.avif?t=1759258940\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/bb268ee861b631b0329ba200ae639f2e.webm?t=1759258940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/bb268ee861b631b0329ba200ae639f2e.mp4?t=1759258940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as Elixia, a mysterious girl with unique psychic powers useful in combat and puzzle-solving. Wield a variety of psychic abilities to survive and overcome challenges. Unleash a forceful blast with the power of a bullet, use telekinesis to manipulate and hurl objects at high speed, cause enemies to implode under immense pressure, and create barriers to block and counter attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/fb4f490ed0f1adb4480a1c3771475503.avif?t=1759258940\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/b61944f339b88c777030a652bc78beee.poster.avif?t=1759258940\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/b61944f339b88c777030a652bc78beee.webm?t=1759258940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/b61944f339b88c777030a652bc78beee.mp4?t=1759258940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face off against dreadful stalkers\u2014twisted creations born from sinister experiments. These relentless creatures possess unique abilities, making them formidable foes who will stop at nothing to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/2d8a98ad60bed345e381a9859ee4339a.avif?t=1759258940\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/ea8af9ee7315c3b9f9a7a70f89fb8d38.poster.avif?t=1759258940\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/ea8af9ee7315c3b9f9a7a70f89fb8d38.webm?t=1759258940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/ea8af9ee7315c3b9f9a7a70f89fb8d38.mp4?t=1759258940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience a fresh take on survival horror that blends classic mechanics like limited resources, backtracking, and puzzle-solving with a dynamic environment, allowing you to adapt and respond to any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forge your own path to survival\u2014whether through intense combat or stealthy evasion. Navigate and interact with a mysterious sci-fi laboratory, exploring freely as you uncover its dangers and secrets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3018390?t=1759258940","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/c7262a83881f0620bd2f4a299e1a712af822cac9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759258940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/0f58c1af88506e7da05d22edd600521ce26268fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759258940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/0f58c1af88506e7da05d22edd600521ce26268fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759258940","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3791840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist Now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If you interested and want to support us, Don't forget to wishlist and follow!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/c33d8633ee97dbe47a526cbf8dd83b45.avif?t=1759258940\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/388869c4c99dbb894df7e0831541fd67.avif?t=1759258940\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A third-person survival horror game. The story follows a girl with psychic power who tries to escape a secret laboratory swarming with grotesque and monstrous creatures. Uncover the truth behind the incident and embark on a thrilling adventure that'll keep you on the edge. Explore a sci-fi setting filled with mystery and danger, where a terror is waiting to attack you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/9d39da558592b7b0e11d513c8ed22025.avif?t=1759258940\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/bb268ee861b631b0329ba200ae639f2e.poster.avif?t=1759258940\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/bb268ee861b631b0329ba200ae639f2e.webm?t=1759258940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/bb268ee861b631b0329ba200ae639f2e.mp4?t=1759258940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as Elixia, a mysterious girl with unique psychic powers useful in combat and puzzle-solving. Wield a variety of psychic abilities to survive and overcome challenges. Unleash a forceful blast with the power of a bullet, use telekinesis to manipulate and hurl objects at high speed, cause enemies to implode under immense pressure, and create barriers to block and counter attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/fb4f490ed0f1adb4480a1c3771475503.avif?t=1759258940\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/b61944f339b88c777030a652bc78beee.poster.avif?t=1759258940\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/b61944f339b88c777030a652bc78beee.webm?t=1759258940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/b61944f339b88c777030a652bc78beee.mp4?t=1759258940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face off against dreadful stalkers\u2014twisted creations born from sinister experiments. These relentless creatures possess unique abilities, making them formidable foes who will stop at nothing to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/2d8a98ad60bed345e381a9859ee4339a.avif?t=1759258940\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/ea8af9ee7315c3b9f9a7a70f89fb8d38.poster.avif?t=1759258940\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/ea8af9ee7315c3b9f9a7a70f89fb8d38.webm?t=1759258940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/ea8af9ee7315c3b9f9a7a70f89fb8d38.mp4?t=1759258940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience a fresh take on survival horror that blends classic mechanics like limited resources, backtracking, and puzzle-solving with a dynamic environment, allowing you to adapt and respond to any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forge your own path to survival\u2014whether through intense combat or stealthy evasion. Navigate and interact with a mysterious sci-fi laboratory, exploring freely as you uncover its dangers and secrets.</p>","developers":["MOON CATALYST CO., LTD."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/e857d1c561dfaf4380ac5d5a63bdeab1a875738d/header.jpg?t=1759258940","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9MOON CATALYST CO., LTD. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><